{"id":"e0902736e45e6217","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-guessing-models.md","title":"PFA Gives Stationarily Many Guessing Models","display":"thm-guessing-models — PFA Gives Stationarily Many Guessing Models","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-guessing-models","aliases":["58-thm-guessing-models","Guessing Models","Internal Approach"],"display":"thm-guessing-models — PFA Gives Stationarily Many Guessing Models","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-model-internally-guessing-model.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-omega2.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-guessing-models"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-guessing-models</span><span>Guessing Models</span><span>Internal Approach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-guessing-models — PFA Gives Stationarily Many Guessing Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4fc856eb9fe0887\" href=\"?note=f4fc856eb9fe0887\" title=\"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md\">../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7540c15cbc294b4d\" href=\"?note=7540c15cbc294b4d\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-model-internally-guessing-model.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-model-internally-guessing-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4c8e863bb75986f\" href=\"?note=b4c8e863bb75986f\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"73db783e2d738e08\" href=\"?note=73db783e2d738e08\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-omega2.md\">../batch18/58-df-omega2.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PFA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PFA}\\)</span>（proper forcing axiom，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f4fc856eb9fe0887\" href=\"?note=f4fc856eb9fe0887\" title=\"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md\">../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H,\\theta)\">\\(\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H,\\theta)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=H_\\theta\">\\(H=H_\\theta\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b4c8e863bb75986f\" href=\"?note=b4c8e863bb75986f\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyGuessingModel}_S(M,\\theta)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyGuessingModel}_S(M,\\theta)\\)</span>（大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>、包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-guessing 初等模型谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7540c15cbc294b4d\" href=\"?note=7540c15cbc294b4d\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-model-internally-guessing-model.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-model-internally-guessing-model.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>（正则基数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\\coloneqq\\{M\\subseteq X:|M|&lt;\\kappa\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\\coloneqq\\{M\\subseteq X:|M|&lt;\\kappa\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PStationary}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{PStationary}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\\)</span>-平稳谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}stationary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PStationary}_S(S,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land X\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land S\\subseteq\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\n\\land\\forall F\\;\\Bigl(\nF:[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\to X\n\\to\\exists M\\in S\\;\\forall s\\in[M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(F(s)\\in M)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}stationary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PStationary}_S(S,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land X\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land S\\subseteq\\mathcal P_\\kappa(X)\n\\land\\forall F\\;\\Bigl(\nF:[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\to X\n\\to\\exists M\\in S\\;\\forall s\\in[M]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(F(s)\\in M)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}models}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PFA}\\to\\forall\\theta\\;\\forall H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land\\omega_2&lt;\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H,\\theta)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{PStationary}_S\\!\\left(\n\\{M\\in\\mathcal P_{\\omega_2}(H):\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyGuessingModel}_S(M,\\theta)\\},\nH,\\omega_2\n\\right)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}models}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PFA}\\to\\forall\\theta\\;\\forall H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\n\\land\\omega_2&lt;\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H,\\theta)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{PStationary}_S\\!\\left(\n\\{M\\in\\mathcal P_{\\omega_2}(H):\n\\mathrm{ZfcModelInternallyGuessingModel}_S(M,\\theta)\\},\nH,\\omega_2\n\\right)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>结论是“平稳多个”大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-guessing 初等模型，而非没有参数限制的单个存在量词。</li>\n<li>这是 PFA 导出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ISP}(\\omega_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{ISP}(\\omega_2)\\)</span> 的 guessing-model 表述。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PStationary}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PStationary}_S\\)</span> 用对每个有限元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\to X\">\\(F:[X]^{&lt;\\omega}\\to X\\)</span> 都存在一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>-闭模型来刻画与所有 club 相交；它不同于序数上的二元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>规范 guessing-model 上游是三元谓词；这里复用已经固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=\\omega_1\">\\(\\delta=\\omega_1\\)</span>、模型大小与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\\subseteq M\">\\(\\omega_1\\subseteq M\\)</span> 的二元封装，避免漏掉第三个参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-thm-pfa.md","status"